# Workflow playbooks

**Automatic** project rules are only the other `.mdc` files in this directory. Longer **workflow** skills live under [`.agents/skills/workflows/`](../../.agents/skills/workflows/README.md).

**Meta index (which skill when):** [`.agents/skills/workflows/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/workflows/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md)

Invoke by `@`-mentioning a file under `.agents/skills/workflows/<name>/` instead of loading every playbook into context.
